  "summary": {
    "zh-CN": "主持人心里藏着一个成语故事，孩子用是非题来猜，猜中就升一关，从“成语小萌新”一路挑战到“成语大宗师”。",
    "en": "The host hides a Chinese idiom story; the child guesses with yes-or-no questions and levels up from Idiom Newbie to Idiom Grandmaster."
  },
